@ Spoken protagonist exchanges. All progression remains in the calling map scripts.

LegendsVoice_WoodsQuestion:
	.string "Are you studying the rifts? I heard\nabout them on the news.\pHave you found out what's\ncausing them?$"

LegendsVoice_SilphAnswer:
	.string "Not yet. These readings could help\nus understand how they form.$"

LegendsVoice_WoodsStand:
	.string "Leave them alone. I'm not letting\nyou take their work.$"

LegendsVoice_WoodsDemand:
	.string "Wait! What device? Who are you\nworking for?$"

LegendsVoice_WoodsConcern:
	.string "Are you both all right? They didn't\nhurt either of you, did they?$"

LegendsVoice_SilphSafe:
	.string "We're safe, thanks to you.\nThey were after the recordings.$"

LegendsVoice_WoodsAgree:
	.string "I'll meet you there. Please be careful\non the way back.$"

LegendsVoice_DevonPromise:
	.string "Another theft? Which way did he go?\nI'll see if I can get it back.$"

LegendsVoice_DevonDirection:
	.string "Toward Rusturf Tunnel, to the east.\nPlease be careful!$"

LegendsVoice_ParcelRecovered:
	.string "I've got your parcel. The thief had\ntaken a man's Wingull, too.\pShe's safe now. What makes these\nparts worth stealing?$"

LegendsVoice_DevonUncertain:
	.string "They're components for our shipment.\nI don't know why Team Aqua wants them.\pOur president needs to hear\nwhat happened.$"

LegendsVoice_DevonAccept:
	.string "All right. I've got questions about\nwhat happened in the woods, too.$"

LegendsVoice_StoneQuestion:
	.string "They mentioned a device, then took\nexactly the recordings they needed.\pDoes that mean the thieves are\ntrying to control the rifts?$"

LegendsVoice_StoneEvidence:
	.string "That's one possibility. We need\nevidence before we can be certain.\pThe components you recovered help\nus measure similar changes at sea.\pWe can't assume every theft is linked.\nBut we must take the risk seriously.\pMy son Steven studies unusual stones.\nHe may recognize the traces we found.$"

LegendsVoice_StoneOffer:
	.string "Then I'll speak to him. Where can\nI find Steven?$"

LegendsVoice_StoneLetter:
	.string "He's investigating near Dewford.\nPlease deliver this letter to him.\pAfterward, take the Devon Parts\nto Captain Stern in Slateport.$"

LegendsVoice_ContactQuestion:
	.string "If I find something, how should\nI get in touch with you?$"

LegendsVoice_BirchQuestion:
	.string "Professor, could the object those men\ntook be opening the rifts?\pI keep hearing about their plans\nonly after they've moved on.$"

LegendsVoice_BirchAnswer:
	.string "Neither do I. But we can't draw\nthat conclusion from what we know.\pThe Silph researcher is comparing\nour readings with reports from Kanto.\pSteven may help us understand the\nobject. I'll coordinate the work here.\pKeep your PokéNav with you. If you\nfind another rift, call us first.$"

LegendsVoice_BirchPromise:
	.string "I will. I want answers, but I'm not\ngoing to walk into one blindly.$"

LegendsVoice_StoneDeparture:
	.string "Dewford first, then Slateport.\nI'll let you know what Steven says.$"

LegendsVoice_PeekoPromise:
	.string "He took your Wingull? I saw someone\nrunning toward the tunnel.\pWait here. I'll see if I can\nbring her back.$"

LegendsVoice_ReleasePeeko:
	.string "Let the Wingull go. She hasn't\ndone anything to you.$"

LegendsVoice_GruntChallenge:
	.string "That parcel belongs to Devon.\nThe Wingull is coming with me, too.$"

LegendsVoice_GruntQuestion:
	.string "Who sent you? What does Team Aqua\nwant with research equipment?$"

LegendsVoice_GruntReply:
	.string "You're asking the wrong grunt!\nI was told to bring it back sealed.\pHere! Take the stupid parcel.\nJust get out of my way!$"

LegendsVoice_PeekoSafe:
	.string "She's safe. He was using her\nto keep people away.$"

LegendsVoice_BrineyIntroduction:
	.string "Thank you for bringing her back.\nThey call me Mr. Briney.\pAnd what's your name?$"

LegendsVoice_PlayerIntroduction:
	.string "I'm {PLAYER}. I came for the parcel,\nbut I couldn't leave her here.$"

LegendsVoice_BrineyPassage:
	.string "I'll remember that, {PLAYER}.\nIf you ever need a hand, come find me.\pMy cottage is by the sea,\njust south of Petalburg Woods.$"

LegendsVoice_PeekoFarewell:
	.string "I will. Get her home safely,\nMr. Briney.$"

LegendsVoice_BrineyRequest:
	.string "Mr. Briney! Sorry to interrupt.\nCould you help me reach Dewford?$"

LegendsVoice_BrineyReason:
	.string "Mr. Stone asked me to take a letter\nto Steven, then a parcel to Slateport.\pThe shipment was stolen. I'd like to\nget it to Captain Stern safely.$"

LegendsVoice_BrineyReady:
	.string "Dewford, please. Thank you for\ntaking us, Mr. Briney.$"

LegendsVoice_BrineyNotYet:
	.string "Not just yet. I need to get\nmy team ready first.$"
